<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ruby Tuesday EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ruby Tuesday EPS view up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everen Securities analyst Dean Haskell said Wednesday he raised his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate for Ruby Tuesday Inc to $1.65 a share from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- The fiscal 1999 estimate is $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- His rating remains outperform.</p>
<p>-- Price targets were raised to $29 a share from $24 for the intermediate term and to $37 from $29 in the long term.</p>
<p>-- Ruby Tuesday shares were up 1/8 at 23-1/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
